OL,3,ANorth Korea could be behind $6.3bn hack
OL,4,Aof crypto exchange Binance, analysts
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FBlockchain intelligence firm TRM Labs
OL,8,Fsays several elements of the attack
OL,9,Fresemble earlier North Korean-linked
OL,10,Fincidents; one North Korea expert says
OL,11,Fcyber warfare is "a tool in [the
OL,12,Fcountry's] arsenal"
OL,14,FBinance's co-CEO Richard Teng says
OL,15,Finitial investigations point to a
OL,16,F"compromised DevOps engineer's laptop"
OL,17,Fgiving hackers access, with a follow-up
OL,18,Fstatement from Binance saying it's
OL,19,F"uncovered additional points of breach"
